// ADDED: Standard Deviation Projection from confirmed C2 extreme to latest opposite LTF structure swing.
// FIXED: Bullish IC-CISD dot now uses a transparent upward-anchored label so it stays below the protected-low wick without overlapping while zooming.
// COMPILE FIX: Visual setting resolvers moved below their input declarations.
// ADDED: Independent IC-CISD dot size control.
// ADDED: Main CISD line style and width controls.
// FIXED: IC-CISD candidate is rebuilt only by the opposing delivery that owns the latest protected extreme.
// FIXED: IC-CISD line starts on its actual delivery-origin candle; dot stays on the protected candle.
// UPDATED: IC-CISD chart text and Protected High/Low visuals removed.
// UPDATED: IC-CISD dot is placed on the exact candle that owns the protected swing, at that candle's high/low.
// UPDATED: IC-CISD line style setting added.
// ADDED: Calculated Bars setting with a default calculation window of 5000 bars.
// This source code is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License 2.0 at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
//@version=6
// FIXED: Only the latest xC2/xC2+PSP label is retained globally across bullish and bearish invalidations.
// FIXED: xC2/xC2+PSP has exclusive display priority over standalone C1 PSP on the same candle.
// FIXED: xC2+PSP strictly represents the failed C2 own saved PSP.
// UPDATED: LTF C1 PSP confirmation displays only "PSP"; C1 prefix removed.
// FIXED: LTF C1 PSP label now uses absolute HTF time anchoring, preventing HTF-only PSP display.
// UPDATED: Floating HTF PSP text now follows Category 02 Chart Text Size.
// ADDED: Category 02 Chart Text Size control for main-chart text except SMT/C.SMT.
// UPDATED: Main-chart C3/C4 text is left-anchored at the opening LTF bar instead of centered in the HTF candle interval.
// FIXED: xC4 requires a confirmed LTF candle close through C3 EQ; live intrabar price crossings no longer invalidate C4.
// UPDATED: xC4 now invalidates only when an LTF candle closes through the fixed C3 equilibrium during the C4 HTF candle. Wick-only and legacy midpoint/defense xC4 rules removed.
// CLEANUP: Removed verified dead code only; active PSP/SMT/C.SMT/C2/C3/C4/CISD/HTF behavior remains unchanged.
// FIXED: Live SMT and C.SMT invalidation clears floating HTF state before UI rendering.
// FIXED: No settings toggle is required to remove an invalidated HTF SMT line/text.
// FRESH MIRROR BUILD: Floating HTF PSP/SMT is driven by the same live state as the main chart.
// PSP vertical placement is mirrored from the chart source: above-high or below-low, never candle-color based.
// SMT state, anchors, symbol text, appearance and removal refresh on the same real-time update as the chart.
// FIXED: C3/C4 text is horizontally centered in its HTF candle interval while vertical placement follows directional swing high/low.
// FIXED: Bearish C3/C4 text follows swing high; bullish C3/C4 text follows swing low and freezes after HTF completion. IC-CISD remains removed.
// FIXED: Bearish C3/C4 text displays above its EQ line; bullish C3/C4 text displays below its EQ line.
// FIXED: On C4 invalidation, C4 EQ/open/fill assembly is removed and the C4 label is preserved as red xC4.
// UPDATED: Floating HTF candle equilibrium line shifted one additional step right, two total steps from its original position.
// FIXED: Floating HTF candle equilibrium line shifted exactly one chart step to the right.
// FIXED: C3/C4 labels now use the exact opening candle bar_index. Bullish labels remain below open and bearish labels remain above open.
// FIXED: Bullish C3/C4 text prints below opening price; bearish C3/C4 text prints above opening price, while remaining left-anchored.
// FIXED: Dynamic C3/C4 Open, EQ and fill now include the full closing width of the last LTF bar, preventing 1m/5m/etc early cutoff.
// FIXED: C3/C4 text is anchored on the left side of the opening candle at its opening price.
// FIXED: C3/C4 text is anchored beside the opening candle at its opening price and no longer moves with dynamic lines/fills.
// UPDATED: C3/C4 EQ, opening-price lines and Open-EQ fills now extend dynamically with each printed chart candle.
// ADDED: Independent color/opacity fill between each C3/C4 opening-price line and its EQ line.
// UPDATED: Removed C3/C4 0.25 and 0.75 quartiles. Each C3/C4 candle is now marked only at its opening price.
// UPDATED: Dedicated History control moved from 07. Floating HTF Candles to 02. Setup Controls.
// UPDATED: Floating HTF candle Count and model History remain independent controls.
// ADDED: Dedicated History input controls C2/PSP/C3/C4/SMT/xC2/EQ/quartile retention.
// COMPILE FIX: History input is declared before all history-dependent variables.
// Increasing or decreasing HTF Count recalculates C2/PSP/C3/C4/SMT/xC2/EQ/quartile history to the same window.
// FIXED: Visible HTF PSP text uses the same PSP state as the tooltip and cannot be suppressed by stale C3/C4 flags.
// FIXED: Confirmed and live C2 role assignment clears stale C3/C4 ownership on the same HTF candle.
// COMPILE FIX: HTFMark constructor uses named fields to prevent positional type mismatch CE10123.
// UPDATED: HTF tooltip shows the correlated asset name responsible for PSP.
// UPDATED: Floating HTF hover tooltip covers the complete candle body and wick using multiple invisible hover targets.
// UPDATED: Floating HTF hover tooltip shows only PSP and SMT information.
// FIXED: Confirmed C2 PSP status is saved permanently with its model and used later for xC2+PSP.
// FIXED: xC2 is created only from a previously CONFIRMED C2 stored in manipulation history.
// A sweep candidate that closes invalid before C2 confirmation is deleted and never becomes xC2.
// FIXED: Floating HTF candles display only PSP text, never xC2, xC2+PSP, C1 PSP, or C2 PSP.
// FIXED: LTF xC2/xC2+PSP labels remain restricted to the original confirmed C2 candle.
// FIXED: HTF xC2/xC2+PSP is restricted to the original C2 candle and can never overwrite C3 or C4 roles.
// FIXED: Floating HTF candle mirrors LTF invalidation text as xC2 or xC2+PSP.
// FIXED: xC2 labels synchronize retroactively when the same candle later confirms as C1 PSP.
// FIXED: Every genuine C2 invalidation path preserves the LTF label as xC2 or xC2+PSP.
// FIXED: LTF xC2 label becomes xC2+PSP when that invalidated C2 candle is the new C1 and has C1 PSP.
// HTF C1/C2 PSP rendering remains unchanged.
// FIXED: Model-role ownership prevents one HTF candle from displaying both C1 PSP and C2 PSP.
// Latest confirmed model assigns one exclusive PSP role per HTF candle.
// FIXED: C1 PSP and C2 PSP use strict, separate HTF timestamps.
// UPDATED: C1 PSP now renders on both the main chart and floating HTF candle.
// UPDATED: Complete TTrades-aligned C1 + C2 PSP closure-disagreement engine.
// C1 PSP is confirmed only after a valid C2 model confirms; C2 PSP keeps live preview and final confirmation.
// UPDATED: C3/C4 fill color inputs fixed and duplicate Fill text removed. Selected fill colors now apply directly to all quartile zones.
// REMOVED: Bull C3, Bull C4, Bear C3, Bear C4 obsolete color boxes.
// ADDED: Optional floating HTF candle equilibrium line with color, width, and style controls.
// FIXED: HTF EQ style identifier declaration-order compile error.
// REMOVED: C2 Bull/Bear border color, transparency, width, and style inputs; C2 boxes are fill-only.
// FIXED: HTF EQ marker now uses a foreground zero-height box, so every displayed candle shows EQ above its body.
// FIXED: Strict CSMT C2->C3 divergence: chart holds C2 extreme while correlated asset takes its own C2 extreme.
// ADDED: User-selectable number of latest HTF open connector lines.
// ADDED: Independent menu toggles for HTF interval labels and HTF-candle SMT text
// ADDED: Group-centred HTF timer with Top/Bottom/Both position and size controls
// FIXED: Robust C2/C3/C4/PSP mapping and visible per-candle HTF marks
// FIXED: XC2 appears only after C2 candle closes invalid; XC4 invalidation text removed
// FIXED: Restored truncated Bullish Sweep Update logic
// FIXED: SMT Lines now map to the HTF floating UI candles
// FIXED: 1-minute delay on HTF candle text marks eliminated by enforcing end-of-script UI drawing and precise time anchoring

// ==========================================================
// LOCAL ASSET CORRELATION UTILS REPLACEMENT (FULLY SEPARATED)
// ==========================================================
type CorrConfig
    string secondary
    string tertiary
    bool invertSecondary
    bool invertTertiary

resolveCurrentChart() =>
    string sec = ""
    string ter = ""
    bool invSec = false
    bool invTer = false
    
    t = syminfo.ticker
    p = syminfo.prefix + ":" 

    if str.contains(t, "BANKNIFTY")
        sec := "NSE:NIFTY"
        ter := "NSE:FINNIFTY"
    else if str.contains(t, "FINNIFTY")
        sec := "NSE:NIFTY"
        ter := "NSE:BANKNIFTY"
    else if str.contains(t, "NIFTY")
        sec := "NSE:BANKNIFTY"
        ter := "NSE:FINNIFTY"
    else if str.contains(t, "SENSEX")
        sec := "NSE:NIFTY"
        ter := "NSE:BANKNIFTY"

    else if str.contains(t, "EURCAD")
        sec := p + "GBPCAD"
        ter := p + "NZDCAD"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "GBPCAD")
        sec := p + "EURCAD"
        ter := p + "GBPNZD"
        invSec := false
    else if str.contains(t, "GBPAUD")
        sec := p + "GBPNZD"
        ter := p + "EURAUD"
        invSec := false
    else if str.contains(t, "EURJPY")
        sec := p + "GBPJPY"
        ter := p + "USDJPY"
        invSec := false
    else if str.contains(t, "EURAUD")
        sec := p + "EURNZD"
        ter := p + "GBPAUD"
        invSec := false
    else if str.contains(t, "6E") or str.contains(t, "EURUSD")
        sec := p + "GBPUSD"
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "6B") or str.contains(t, "GBPUSD")
        sec := p + "EURUSD"
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "6A") or str.contains(t, "AUDUSD")
        sec := p + "NZDUSD"
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "6N") or str.contains(t, "NZDUSD")
        sec := p + "AUDUSD"
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "USDCHF")
        sec := p + "EURUSD"
        ter := p + "GBPUSD"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "USDCAD")
        sec := p + "USDCHF"
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "GBPJPY")
        sec := p + "EURJPY"
        ter := p + "CADJPY"
        invSec := true
    else if str.contains(t, "6J") or str.contains(t, "USDJPY")
        sec := p + "USDCHF"
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
    else if str.contains(t, "GC")  
        sec := "COMEX:SI1!"        
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invTer := true
    else if str.contains(t, "SI")  
        sec := "COMEX:GC1!"        
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
        invTer := true
    else if str.contains(t, "CL")  
        sec := "NYMEX:NG1!"        
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
    else if str.contains(t, "NG")  
        sec := "NYMEX:CL1!"        
        ter := "TVC:DXY"
    else if str.contains(t, "XAU")
        sec := p + "XAGUSD"
        ter := p + "COPPER"
        invTer := true
    else if str.contains(t, "GOLD")
        sec := p + "SILVER"
        ter := p + "COPPER"
        invTer := true
    else if str.contains(t, "XAG")
        sec := p + "XAUUSD"
        ter := p + "COPPER"
        invTer := true
    else if str.contains(t, "SILVER")
        sec := p + "GOLD"
        ter := p + "COPPER"
        invTer := true
    else if str.contains(t, "USOIL")
        sec := p + "UKOIL"         
        ter := "TVC:DXY"           
    else if str.contains(t, "UKOIL")
        sec := p + "USOIL"         
        ter := "TVC:DXY"           
    else if str.contains(t, "BTC")
        sec := p + "ETHUSDT"
        ter := p + "SOLUSDT"
    else if str.contains(t, "ETH")
        sec := p + "BTCUSDT"
        ter := p + "SOLUSDT"
    else if str.contains(t, "SOL")
        sec := p + "BTCUSDT"
        ter := p + "ETHUSDT"
    else if str.contains(t, "XRP")
        sec := p + "XLMUSDT"
        ter := p + "SOLUSDT"
    else if str.contains(t, "NQ") or str.contains(t, "MNQ")
        sec := "CME_MINI:ES1!"
        ter := "CBOT_MINI:YM1!"
    else if str.contains(t, "ES") or str.contains(t, "MES")
        sec := "CME_MINI:NQ1!"
        ter := "CBOT_MINI:YM1!"
    else if str.contains(t, "YM") or str.contains(t, "MYM")
        sec := "CME_MINI:ES1!"
        ter := "CME_MINI:NQ1!"
    else if str.contains(t, "US100")
        sec := p + "US500"
        ter := p + "US30"
    else if str.contains(t, "US500")
        sec := p + "US100"
        ter := p + "US30"
    else if str.contains(t, "NAS100")
        sec := p + "SPX500"
        ter := p + "US30"
    else if str.contains(t, "SPX") or str.contains(t, "SPX500")
        sec := p + "NAS100"
        ter := p + "US30"
    else if str.contains(t, "US30") or str.contains(t, "DJI")
        sec := p + "US500"
        ter := p + "US100"

    CorrConfig.new(sec, ter, invSec, invTer)

indicator("[KNIGHT♞] Ψ FM pro+", overlay=true, max_boxes_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_labels_count=500, calc_bars_count=5000)

// ==========================================================
// 0. MARKET BIAS
// ==========================================================
grp_bias = "01. Directional Bias"
bias_in = input.string("Neutral", "Directional Bias", options=["Neutral", "Bullish", "Bearish"], group=grp_bias, tooltip="Neutral: Shows all setups.\nBullish: Shows only setups from swept lows (Longs).\nBearish: Shows only setups from swept highs (Shorts).")

allow_bull = bias_in == "Neutral" or bias_in == "Bullish"
allow_bear = bias_in == "Neutral" or bias_in == "Bearish"

// ==========================================================
// 1. AMD + CISD + HTF + PSP
// ==========================================================
grp_core = "02. Setup Controls"
grp_c2_style = "03. C2 Manipulation Style"
grp_c3_levels = "04. C3 Levels: EQ + Opening Price"
grp_c4_levels = "05. C4 Levels: EQ + Opening Price"
grp_cisd = "06. CISD"
grp_sd_projection = "07. Standard Deviation Projection"
grp_htf_main = "08. Floating HTF Candles"
grp_htf_eq = "09. Floating HTF Equilibrium"
grp_htf_open = "10. HTF Open Connectors"
grp_htf_timer = "11. HTF Labels and Timer"

use_frac     = input.bool(true, "C2", inline="frac0", group=grp_core)
use_psp      = input.bool(true, "PSP", inline="frac0", group=grp_core)
use_dist     = input.bool(true, "C3", inline="frac0", group=grp_core)
use_cont     = input.bool(true, "C4", inline="frac0", group=grp_core)
htf_history_count = input.int(10, "History", minval=1, maxval=50, inline="frac_hist", group=grp_core, tooltip="Independent model history. Controls retained C2/PSP/C3/C4/SMT/xC2/EQ/quartile drawings without changing floating HTF candle Count.")
int bull_history = htf_history_count
int bear_history = htf_history_count
col_c3_eq_line = input.color(color.new(#9c9c9c, 70), "C3 EQ", inline="c3eq", group=grp_c3_levels)
c3_eq_width    = input.int(1, "Width", minval=1, maxval=10, inline="c3eq", group=grp_c3_levels)
c3_eq_style_in = input.string("Solid", "Style", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="c3eq", group=grp_c3_levels)
col_c4_eq_line = input.color(color.new(#9c9c9c, 70), "C4 EQ", inline="c4eq", group=grp_c4_levels)
c4_eq_width    = input.int(1, "Width", minval=1, maxval=10, inline="c4eq", group=grp_c4_levels)
c4_eq_style_in = input.string("Solid", "Style", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="c4eq", group=grp_c4_levels)
// C3 bullish opening-price marker
show_bull_c3_quartiles = input.bool(true, "Bull C3 Open", inline="bc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
col_bull_c3_quartile = input.color(color.new(#2e2e2e, 70), "Line", inline="bc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
bull_c3_quartile_width = input.int(1, "W", minval=1, maxval=10, inline="bc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
bull_c3_quartile_style_in = input.string("Solid", "S", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="bc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
show_bull_c3_fill = input.bool(true, "Open-EQ Fill", inline="bc3fill", group=grp_c3_levels)
col_bull_c3_fill = input.color(color.new(#808080, 90), "Color", inline="bc3fill", group=grp_c3_levels, tooltip="Fill between the Bull C3 opening price and C3 EQ. Opacity is controlled from this color picker.")
// C3 bearish opening-price marker
show_bear_c3_quartiles = input.bool(true, "Bear C3 Open", inline="rc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
col_bear_c3_quartile = input.color(color.new(#2e2e2e, 70), "Line", inline="rc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
bear_c3_quartile_width = input.int(1, "W", minval=1, maxval=10, inline="rc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
bear_c3_quartile_style_in = input.string("Solid", "S", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="rc3q1", group=grp_c3_levels)
show_bear_c3_fill = input.bool(true, "Open-EQ Fill", inline="rc3fill", group=grp_c3_levels)
col_bear_c3_fill = input.color(color.new(#808080, 90), "Color", inline="rc3fill", group=grp_c3_levels, tooltip="Fill between the Bear C3 opening price and C3 EQ. Opacity is controlled from this color picker.")
// C4 bullish opening-price marker
show_bull_c4_quartiles = input.bool(true, "Bull C4 Open", inline="bc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
col_bull_c4_quartile = input.color(color.new(#2e2e2e, 70), "Line", inline="bc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
bull_c4_quartile_width = input.int(1, "W", minval=1, maxval=10, inline="bc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
bull_c4_quartile_style_in = input.string("Solid", "S", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="bc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
show_bull_c4_fill = input.bool(true, "Open-EQ Fill", inline="bc4fill", group=grp_c4_levels)
col_bull_c4_fill = input.color(color.new(#808080, 90), "Color", inline="bc4fill", group=grp_c4_levels, tooltip="Fill between the Bull C4 opening price and C4 EQ. Opacity is controlled from this color picker.")
// C4 bearish opening-price marker
show_bear_c4_quartiles = input.bool(true, "Bear C4 Open", inline="rc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
col_bear_c4_quartile = input.color(color.new(#2e2e2e, 70), "Line", inline="rc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
bear_c4_quartile_width = input.int(1, "W", minval=1, maxval=10, inline="rc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
bear_c4_quartile_style_in = input.string("Solid", "S", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="rc4q1", group=grp_c4_levels)
show_bear_c4_fill = input.bool(true, "Open-EQ Fill", inline="rc4fill", group=grp_c4_levels)
col_bear_c4_fill = input.color(color.new(#808080, 90), "Color", inline="rc4fill", group=grp_c4_levels, tooltip="Fill between the Bear C4 opening price and C4 EQ. Opacity is controlled from this color picker.")
// PSP uses strict correlated closure disagreement. No legacy reversal/reclaim mode.


col_bull_bg      = input.color(color.new(#9e9e9e, 90), "Bull Box", inline="frac1", group=grp_c2_style)
col_bull_line    = input.color(#9c9c9c, "Bull Line", inline="frac1", group=grp_c2_style)
col_bear_bg      = input.color(color.new(#9e9e9e, 90), "Bear Box", inline="frac2", group=grp_c2_style)
col_bear_line    = input.color(#9c9c9c, "Bear Line", inline="frac2", group=grp_c2_style)
manip_txt_col = input.color(color.rgb(0, 0, 0), "Text", inline="frac3", group=grp_core)
chart_text_size_in = input.string("Small", "Chart Text Size", options=["Tiny", "Small", "Normal", "Large", "Huge"], inline="frac3", group=grp_core, tooltip="Adjusts main-chart C1 PSP, C2/xC2, C3, C4/xC4 and CISD text. SMT and C.SMT keep their separate text-size setting.")
chart_text_size = chart_text_size_in == "Tiny" ? size.tiny : chart_text_size_in == "Normal" ? size.normal : chart_text_size_in == "Large" ? size.large : chart_text_size_in == "Huge" ? size.huge : size.small


c3_eq_style = c3_eq_style_in == "Dashed" ? line.style_dashed : c3_eq_style_in == "Dotted" ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid
c4_eq_style = c4_eq_style_in == "Dashed" ? line.style_dashed : c4_eq_style_in == "Dotted" ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid
bull_c3_quartile_style = bull_c3_quartile_style_in == "Dashed" ? line.style_dashed : bull_c3_quartile_style_in == "Dotted" ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid
bear_c3_quartile_style = bear_c3_quartile_style_in == "Dashed" ? line.style_dashed : bear_c3_quartile_style_in == "Dotted" ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid
bull_c4_quartile_style = bull_c4_quartile_style_in == "Dashed" ? line.style_dashed : bull_c4_quartile_style_in == "Dotted" ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid
bear_c4_quartile_style = bear_c4_quartile_style_in == "Dashed" ? line.style_dashed : bear_c4_quartile_style_in == "Dotted" ? line.style_dotted : line.style_solid

// Standard-deviation projection uses the confirmed C2 extreme and the latest
// opposite LTF structure swing found before that extreme.
show_sd_projection = input.bool(true, "Projection ON/OFF", inline="sd0", group=grp_sd_projection)
sd_projection_levels = input.string("-1,-1.5,-2,-2.5,-3.5,-4", "Levels", inline="sd0", group=grp_sd_projection, tooltip="Comma-separated levels. 1 = C2 extreme, 0 = structure anchor, negative levels project beyond the structure anchor.")
show_sd_projection_labels = input.bool(true, "Labels", inline="sd1", group=grp_sd_projection)
sd_projection_label_size_in = input.string("Normal", "Size", options=["Tiny", "Small", "Normal", "Large"], inline="sd1", group=grp_sd_projection)
sd_projection_color = input.color(color.new(color.black, 0), "Color", inline="sd2", group=grp_sd_projection)
sd_projection_width = input.int(1, "Width", minval=1, maxval=5, inline="sd2", group=grp_sd_projection)
sd_projection_style_in = input.string("Dotted", "Style", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="sd2", group=grp_sd_projection)

use_cisd       = input.bool(true, "CISD ON/OFF", inline="cisd0", group=grp_cisd)
hist_plus_cisd = input.int(1, "+Hist", minval=0, maxval=100, inline="cisd0", group=grp_cisd)
hist_minus_cisd = input.int(1, "-Hist", minval=0, maxval=100, inline="cisd0", group=grp_cisd)
extend_cisd_bars = input.int(5, "Extend", minval=0, tooltip="Set how many bars the line should extend after confirmation.", inline="cisd0", group=grp_cisd)
col_bull_conf  = input.color(color.new(#2962ff, 0), "+CISD", inline="cisd1", group=grp_cisd)
col_bear_conf  = input.color(color.new(#f23645, 0), "-CISD", inline="cisd1", group=grp_cisd)
col_pend       = input.color(color.new(#b8b8b8, 0), "Pending", inline="cisd1", group=grp_cisd)
cisd_line_width = input.int(3, "CISD Width", minval=1, maxval=5, inline="cisd2", group=grp_cisd)
cisd_line_style_input = input.string("Solid", "CISD Style", options=["Solid", "Dashed", "Dotted"], inline="cisd2", group=grp_cisd)
// TTrades-style Intracandle CISD settings.
use_ic_cisd = input.bool(true, "IC-CISD ON/OFF", inline="icc0", group=grp_cisd)
ic_cisd_history = input.int(10, "History", minval=1, maxval=50, inline="icc0", group=grp_cisd)
